  (text "10 A pass-through measurement and mode relay"
    (at 16.51 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1db4924b-96ff-4d66-8592-b2819726edbd")
  )
  (text "I_PT = 2 mOhm x 100\n= 0.2 V/A (10 A -> 2.0 V).\nRelay: NC = precision path\n(default), NO = pass-through.\nSwitched only with the output\nswitch off (no hot switching)."
    (at 165.1 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6d8594cf-7145-4bea-a993-3db5fcc09fef")
  )
  (text "Output switch: back-to-back N-FETs, photovoltaic gate driver"
    (at 16.51 142.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4370b53a-4fe9-42a4-9978-b3db6a9b009c")
  )
  (text "Works at any output voltage (0 ... 30 V).\nLED 20 mA -> ~30 uA gate current:\nturn-on ~3 ms, turn-off ~0.1 ms.\nOCP_TRIP shorts the LED (Q505).\nQ502 / Q503 share the source node:\nboth body diodes block when off."
    (at 127 175.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "661f0d47-a7e0-41b7-9d01-4d94230309e7")
  )
  (text "Output terminals and terminal voltage sense"
    (at 217.17 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6946a841-de34-45a0-9b17-761b821bc46c")
  )
  (text "VOUT_TERM = OUT_P / 10.09 at the terminals: firmware trims the CV setpoint for the relay +\nswitch drop (slow outer loop) and subtracts the divider current (VOUT / 1.11 MOhm) from I."
    (at 220.98 109.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0894c744-6380-4d01-b343-d8a7e4038aa6")
  )
